<title>PHILIPPINES: Cebu Holdings offers two for five rights.</title>
<headline>Cebu Holdings offers two for five rights.</headline>
<dateline>MANILA 1997-07-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Cebu Holdings Inc told the Philippine Stock Exchange on Thursday it had approved a two-for-five stock rights offer at a cost of one peso per share.</p>
<p>The record date and offer period will be announced later, the company said in a statement.</p>
<p>The new issue of approximately 768 million shares will come from the increase in capital stock, it said.</p>
<p>-- Manila newsroom (632) 841 8934</p>
</text>
